  "description": {
   "en": "A very ordinary and serious high school student, Kamou-kun. Though his days are filled with diligent study, his concern lies in his childhood friend, Katabami-san, who interferes with his studies every day. And to make matters more complicated, Katabami-san's true identity is… a fox spirit!?\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [niconico Manga](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/66393)",
   "ja": "幼馴染みは…化け狐！？\n\nごく普通の真面目な男子高校生、賀茂（かも）くん。勉強に励む日々だったが、悩みは幼馴染みの片喰（かたばみ）さんが毎日勉強の邪魔をしてくること。しかも片喰さんの正体は……化け狐だった！？"
  },
